          <h3 class="post-title">NIUA</h3>
          <p class="post-stack">Agent harness · a run leaves a receipt</p>
          <p>
            NIUA is the harness. An agent is handed tools, does the job, and is not finished until it returns a receipt you can check.
          </p>
          <p>
            On the shipped surface that receipt is playtest evidence: input, assert, screenshot. The run has to show its work.
